sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D1 as worker 1: delete doc d
    participant D2 as worker 2: delete doc d
    participant R as regolith

    D1->>R: get(d): present
    D2->>R: get(d): present
    D1->>R: put deletion marker, delete index entries
    D2->>R: put deletion marker, delete index entries
    D1->>R: commit
    R-->>D1: committed
    D2->>R: commit
    Note over R: the key it read changed: the only conflict left on document paths
    R-->>D2: Conflict: mine Read, theirs Delete
    Note over D2: business logic: already deleted, return success as a no-op
    Note over D1,D2: a blind delete of an already deleted key would not even conflict: it is elided
